{
  "key": 33815,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignTakeThisTM",
      "en_US": [
        "Santoryu?\r",
        "Nitoryu?\r",
        "All you need is one sword to\n",
        "perform the Turning Swallow Cut!\r",
        "Your enemies will be cut down\n",
        "before they can even blink!\r",
        "But swordsmanship is difficult in\n",
        "my old age...\r",
        "Your Pokémon can perform a similar\n",
        "technique too, you know.\r",
        "Take this TM, youngster.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignTM40IsAerialAce",
      "en_US": [
        "That TM contains Aerial Ace.\r",
        "With its swiftness and accuracy, the\n",
        "move will never miss its target."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignIMissTheSword",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, I do miss practicing the way\n",
        "of the sword in my youth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignAskTradeCherubiForSkorupi",
      "en_US": [
        "By any chance, do you have a Pokémon\n",
        "called CHERUBI?\r",
        "If you do, would you like to trade\n",
        "your CHERUBI for my SKORUPI?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignTreatMySkorupiNicely",
      "en_US": [
        "SKORUPI isn’t fitting for such a\n",
        "beautiful lady like myself.\r",
        "Just kidding!\r",
        "Please treat my SKORUPI nicely.\n",
        "I’ll be good to your CHERUBI, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignIAskedForCherubi",
      "en_US": [
        "What I asked for was a CHERUBI...?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignOKIfYouDontWant",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s OK if you don’t want to.\r",
        "But if you change your mind, let’s\n",
        "trade Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_SovereignWeGotToBeFriends",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks to Pokémon, we got to be\n",
        "friends, didn’t we?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
